Viktor 05.10.2026:
· «ленивую подгрузку карточек семплов цельными строками? При 3 в полосе - 30, При 4 в полосе - 32, и т.п. Чтобы DOM не
  насиловать в Библиотеке»: a batch is the row's count times as many rows as make thirty or just over (3 → 30, 4 → 32,
  5 → 30, 7 → 35); the next comes as the end nears (a sentinel under the grid, 900 px ahead, again while it stays in sight);
  a repaint keeps as many as were shown, in whole rows of the width it has now; a new view (place, search, filters, sort,
  tiles or list) starts from one batch; a take to reveal brings in the rows before it. Select all, the bulk acts and the
  player go by the list, not by the cards drawn. Checked at 1920 px: 4 a row, 32 first, 96 and 160 on scrolling.
· «В Библиотеке переход по воркспейсам не синхронизирует выбор в баре»: a workspace opened in the Librarian (its list, or
  Open in its menu) is the one in hand in the bar too (new takes land in it, the rooms' column shows it); All Workspaces is
  All again; the studio's own views (favourites, pinned, hidden, not in a workspace, the trash) and a frozen workspace leave
  the bar as it is.
· «Для чекбокса "показывать непонравившиеся" очень длинный текст… у нас же уже есть фильтр по UP/DOWN. Зря прикрутили это»:
  the box goes; the 👎 filter shows the disliked (the column's ⋯ keeps «The disliked ones too», one setting with the
  Librarian), the dislike's toast names it; the 👍 and 👎 filters are the cards' one-colour icons, each with its tip.
3 keys in the six catalogs. cdp-console 334/0/7, check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

